  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"110\" id=\"isPasted\">Brand Introduction</h3><p data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"407\"><strong data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"123\">Standún</strong> is a family-run clothing and gift department store established in 1946 by May and Máirtín Standún in Spiddal, Connemara, Co. Galway. <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">The store has been passed down through generations and is now managed by their granddaughters, Clíona and Laragh Standún.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Standún has grown from a modest two-bedroom bungalow selling groceries to a bustling destination store for locals and tourists alike, embodying love, tradition, and community spirit.</span>&nbsp;</p><h3 data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"440\">Product Description</h3><p data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"496\">Standún offers a diverse range of products, including:</p><ul data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"923\"><li data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"556\"><p data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"556\"><strong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"517\">Aran Knitwear</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Handcrafted Aran sweaters, cardigans, ponchos, and accessories, showcasing traditional Irish craftsmanship.</span></p></li><li data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"642\"><p data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"642\"><strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"601\">Ladies, Men's, and Children's Clothing</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A curated selection of contemporary and classic fashion pieces.</span></p></li><li data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"699\"><p data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"699\"><strong data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"658\">Jewellery</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Elegant pieces from renowned Irish designers.</span></p></li><li data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"759\"><p data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"759\"><strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"718\">Home &amp; Gifts</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Decorative accessories, blankets, throws, tableware, glassware, and more.</span></p></li><li data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"824\"><p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"824\"><strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"783\">Beauty &amp; Wellness</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Skincare, bath &amp; body products, and candles.</span></p></li><li data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"923\"><p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"923\"><strong data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"842\">Irish Gifts</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Unique items reflecting Irish culture and heritage.</span>&nbsp;</p></li></ul><h3 data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"963\">&nbsp;Unique Selling Point</h3><p data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1184\">Standún is celebrated as <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1024\">\"The Home of The Aran Sweater\"</strong>, <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">being the first to export these traditional garments to the USA.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">The store specializes in iconic Aran knitwear, offering authentic, handcrafted pieces that embody Irish heritage and craftsmanship.</span>&nbsp;</p><h3 data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1211\">Payment Terms</h3><p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1372\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Standún provides <strong data-start=\"17\" data-end=\"76\">free tracked shipping on orders over €60 within Ireland</strong>.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">For orders under €60, a shipping fee of €4.99 applies.</span> <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">The website supports multiple currencies, including EUR, GBP, USD, AUD, and CAD, allowing international customers to shop conveniently.</span></p><p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1372\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Other Information</span></strong></p><ul data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1709\"><li data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1501\"><p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1501\"><strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1420\">Locations</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Standún operates two stores in Ireland: one in Spiddal, Co. Galway, and another in Oughterard, Co. Galway.</span>&nbsp;</p></li><li data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1562\"><p data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1562\"><strong data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1520\">Online Store</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Customers can explore and purchase products through their online store at <a href=\"https://standun.com\" data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"108\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_new\">standun.com</a>.</span></p></li><li data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1709\"><p data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1709\"><strong data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1589\">Community Engagement</strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Standún is a cherished meeting hub for friends, families, and visiting tourists, reflecting its deep-rooted connection to the local community.</span></p></li></ul></div></div>",
